["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What to Know Before (and After) You Hire an Advisor (w/ Matthew Taylor) | #427 risk capacity IRR gating exempt market inoculation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-rationalreminder-私募资产卖给散户-没有市价-估值就成了权力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>私募資產賣給散戶：沒有市價，估值就成了權力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公開市場有披露、審計、分析師和媒體四重制衡，私募資產把這一切刻意剝離。沒有活躍交易就沒有市價，估值只能由管理人自己做，而估值直接決定你申購和贖回時拿到多少份額。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">私募資產</span><span class=\"tag\">受託責任</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"How two swing states changed American voting Operation Eagle Eye wildcat strike Arab Workers Caucus UAW\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-throughline-大法官曾带人堵投票站-四十年后成了全国战术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a37e209235148afd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>大法官曾帶人堵投票站，四十年後成了全國戰術</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">倫奎斯特1962年在鳳凰城挑戰黑人選民資格，兩年後這套打法變成全國性的「鷹眼行動」；而底特律阿拉伯裔工人用一場野貓罷工，從工廠里長出了政治力量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span><span class=\"tag\">投票權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Archive: Rosalind Franklin X-ray crystallography Photo 51 A-form / B-form DNA space group tobacco mosaic virus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-inourtime-富兰克林没拿到诺贝尔奖-不只是因为早逝/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b92ca842f2a04535-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">51:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>富蘭克林沒拿到諾貝爾獎，不只是因為早逝</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她拍出照片51號，也最早發現DNA兩種形態可互相轉換；但真正讓她被歷史低估的，是國王學院實驗室拒絕共享信息，而劍橋在共享。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科學史</span><span class=\"tag\">DNA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Francis Fukuyama Is Seeing at &#x27;The End of History&#x27; megalothymia thumos agentic AI the last man\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-oddlots-福山-自由民主的敌人不是专制-是无聊/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">54:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>福山：自由民主的敵人不是專制，是無聊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">尼采說的「最後的人」不是被壓迫者，而是被餵飽、被承認、卻再也不想爭取任何東西的人——福山認為這才是當下極端主義真正的燃料。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>15</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">自由民主</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Advice Line with Michelle Wahler of Beyond Yoga cohort second first impression under promise and over deliver\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-howibuilt-创始人最该学的不是融资-是学会说不/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">41:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>創始人最該學的不是融資，是學會說不</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Beyond Yoga 創始人 Michelle Wahler 說，創業不必融資、不必規劃退出，把生意做成可持續的就好；她丈夫當年攔住她做泳衣，逼她先把一條瑜伽褲做到最好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業建議</span><span class=\"tag\">融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Forced vacations are a fraud control float Schelling point five nines chaos monkey\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-complexsys-银行放假不是效率低-是反内部欺诈的控制手段/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9506e20ee39946a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">28:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>銀行放假不是效率低，是反內部欺詐的控制手段</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">金融系統週末和假日停擺，看起來像技術落後，其實是一種刻意設計的控制：讓同謀者無法同時坐在鍵盤前，從而暴露內部欺詐。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">運營風險</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Strait talk: Why the oil crisis is getting worse Strait of Bab-el-Mandeb Barim Island Schrodinger Strait choke point\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-indicator-胡塞武装掐住第二个海峡-油价破百只是开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">8:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Indicator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>胡塞武裝掐住第二個海峽，油價破百只是開始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">紅海航運量已從峰值腰斬且從未恢復，如今胡塞武裝拿下曼德海峽中的丕林島，沙特繞開霍爾木茲的替代出口路線也懸了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span><span class=\"tag\">油價</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"From Voice Agents to AI Avatars with Alexander Smola - #777 Proactbench Ibench back channeling millennial sandwich theory of the mind\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-twiml-语音-ai-的瓶颈不是模型-是-150-毫秒的生物学约束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/12967175c59e351e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TWIML AI</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>語音 AI 的瓶頸不是模型，是 150 毫秒的生物學約束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人類視聽感知只有 6-10 赫茲，模型必須在這個時間窗內被打斷；而高保真音頻意味著每秒更多 token，token 越多參數就得越小——這是語音 AI 繞不開的物理取捨。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">語音AI</span><span class=\"tag\">多模態</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Ice Age America: The Clovis Culture Clovis points fluting ZooMS ochre hearth-centered areas overkill debate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-ancients-克洛维斯人不是只会猎猛犸-他们还在帐篷里画画缝衣/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/baa588ecfd782397-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>克洛維斯人不是只會獵猛獁，他們還在帳篷裡畫畫縫衣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">懷俄明LaPrele遺址挖出四個火塘中心區、赭石顏料和骨針，DNA蛋白質分析顯示針是用紅狐和貓科動物的骨頭做的——克洛維斯人的食譜遠比「猛獁獵人」這個標籤複雜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">冰期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"#502 – Psychiatry, Insane Asylums, Mental Illness, ECT, Lobotomies, Freud &amp; Jung serendipitous event shell game without a P lobotomobile diagnostic creep tardive dyskinesia CATIE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-lex-精神病学两百年的教训-没有青霉素-只有试错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d67cbc9ec26fc241-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">3:25:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Lex Fridman</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>精神病學兩百年的教訓：沒有青黴素，只有試錯</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從冰錐額葉切除術到胰島素昏迷，精神病學反覆宣稱 80% 治癒率，卻始終沒有一種精神科的青黴素——今天最好的藥，仍有八成患者中途退出試驗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神病學</span><span class=\"tag\">醫學史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Knights vs Ottomans: The Great Siege of Malta Traccia Italiana scorched earth Grand Master corsair\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-historyhit-奥斯曼四万大军围攻马耳他-为何败给几百骑士/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9f68700f4e1f904-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">28:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>奧斯曼四萬大軍圍攻馬耳他，為何敗給幾百騎士</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1565 年奧斯曼艦隊 180 艘船、四萬人圍攻馬耳他，守軍只有約 500 名騎士和幾千馬耳他人。聖埃爾莫堡硬撐一個月後陷落，但拖到九月西西里援軍登陸，奧斯曼人撤退。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">軍事</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"706. Queen Victoria’s Revenge: Storming the Citadel (Part 2) Maria Theresa thaler Snider breech-loading rifle khaki Ferenjis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-restishistory-英国远征埃塞俄比亚-一场用铁路和大象打赢的人质危机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d9d0cedd270ca9a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>英國遠征埃塞俄比亞：一場用鐵路和大象打贏的人質危機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1868年英國為救幾十名人質，花掉一千萬英鎊、運去44頭大象和20英里鐵軌，用後膛槍對長矛打出一場屠殺——然後立刻撤走，留下埃塞俄比亞二十年內戰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">帝國史</span><span class=\"tag\">人質危機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.275 澳洲保健品是怎麼火起來的? TGA AUSTL AUSTR GMP CMO / CDMO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-bizthisway-澳洲保健品监管像药-但没人管它有没有效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">39:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商業就是這樣</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>澳洲保健品監管像藥，但沒人管它有沒有效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">澳洲把保健品和藥品放在同一個機構下監管，看上去很嚴格；但功效既不在上市前審查，也不在生產環節被檢驗——「好」的印象是被營銷和跨境政策植入的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">保健品</span><span class=\"tag\">監管套利</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"396. Stalin: The Bolshevik Revolution (Part 2) Cheka political commissar General Secretary White Russians\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-empirehist-列宁设计了恐怖机器-斯大林只是接手了它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">44:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>列寧設計了恐怖機器，斯大林只是接手了它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">秘密警察、勞改營、一黨制都是列寧留下的架構，斯大林做的是把它變成個人權力工具——他當總書記後第一件事就是往關鍵崗位塞自己人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘇聯史</span><span class=\"tag\">斯大林</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why You Don&#x27;t Need a Co-Founder to Start | Dave Morin, Offline Ventures Company OS idea maze agentic engineering\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-solofounders-单人创始人不是一个人-关系才是产品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2a0f466f68788060-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>單人創始人不是一個人：關係才是產品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">85% 的創業公司死於關係沒成，不是產品想法差。單人創始人的真正含義是當個獨奏藝術家，把找關係當成主業，而不是真的一個人扛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">單人創業</span><span class=\"tag\">創始人關係</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Underwriting Superintelligence: Backing Agents you can Sue — Rune Kvist, AIUC AIUC-1 eval awareness groundedness filter lemon problem CAISI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-latentspace-ai-落地的瓶颈不是能力-是没人敢签字担责/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6979f3df4fdf5281-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>AI 落地的瓶頸不是能力，是沒人敢簽字擔責</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Waymo 四年前就比人開得好，卻至今進不了機場——約束 AI 有用性的從來不是能力，而是責任、風險和信任。AIUC 想用標準加保險補上這塊信心基礎設施。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 合規</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 保險</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Transplanted human brain-tissue takes root in mice without a cortex organoid pallium xenocortical mice paper to agent AlphaGenome\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-naturepod-人脑类器官移植进小鼠-长出了四百万人类神经元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">28:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>人腦類器官移植進小鼠，長出了四百萬人類神經元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鼠被基因手段刪掉幾乎整個皮層，植入人腦類器官後長出約400萬人類神經元，行為既不像正常鼠也不像無皮層鼠，而是第三種狀態。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神經科學</span><span class=\"tag\">類器官</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"For Want of a Resistor clock buffer HCSL probe effect 0201 stencil\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-oxideandfriend-一颗三美元的时钟缓冲器-差点让整家计算机公司停摆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eb3630bdee64e189-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>一顆三美元的時鐘緩衝器，差點讓整家計算機公司停擺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 需求爆發後，第九代 PCIe 時鐘緩衝器被掃空，替代品又踩中 HCSL 端接的隱蔽差異。最後救回產線的不是芯片，是一顆 0201 電阻。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬件供應鏈</span><span class=\"tag\">PCIe</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Beyond the Hype: Dr. Xiao Liu on Evaluating Medical AI Delphi study CONSORT SPIRIT white dot syndromes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-nejmaigrandrou-ai-评估的混乱不是技术问题-是透明度问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff7071d8628d0546-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">43:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">NEJM AI Grand Rounds</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>AI 評估的混亂不是技術問題，是透明度問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2019 年那篇系統綜述裡，只有不到 5% 的醫學影像 AI 論文達到了其他醫學領域早已確立的嚴謹標準，而表現最好的模型也只是與放射科醫生持平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">臨床驗證</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Coley&#x27;s Toxins and the Origins of Immunotherapy erysipelas Bacillus prodigiosus BCG tumor necrosis factor (TNF)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-stuffmissed-他用细菌毒素治癌症-被同行骂了四十年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>他用細菌毒素治癌症，被同行罵了四十年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Coley 用鏈球菌毒素讓部分肉瘤患者腫瘤消失，但無法標準化、無法解釋機制，最終被放療和監管擠出局；他的女兒用後半生為這套療法建起了癌症研究所。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫學史</span><span class=\"tag\">癌症免疫治療</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ron Rothblum on Fiat-Shamir Attacks, Flock and SNARK.fast Fiat-Shamir GKR diagonalization polynomial commitment scheme sketched code binary fields\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-zeroknowledge-fiat-shamir-攻击不是误用-是协议本身不安全/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7dca63fe71cd70d3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Z\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Zero Knowledge</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>Fiat-Shamir 攻擊不是誤用，是協議本身不安全</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">GKR 這類真實部署的協議，在標準 Fiat-Shamir 下可被證明假命題為真；這不是實現疏忽，是變換本身的問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零知識證明</span><span class=\"tag\">Fiat-Shamir</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Annie Lowrey on the Time Tax, Fraud, and Rationing by Paperwork time tax TANF submerged benefits Jevons paradox improper payment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-tyler-政府不只浪费你的钱-还浪费你每周一小时/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0fc39ddaf6ffc3b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">56:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>政府不只浪費你的錢，還浪費你每週一小時</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國人不自己報稅的國家有一堆，IRS 卻被法律禁止替你做。時間稅最狠的不是富人，是窮人、移民和進過監獄的人——而 AI 未必救得了他們。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共政策</span><span class=\"tag\">行政負擔</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The AI-Native CRM business world model greenfield / brownfield schema hopium ICP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-a16z-tome-做到-2500-万用户后-他推倒重来去做-crm/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>Tome 做到 2500 萬用戶後，他推倒重來去做 CRM</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Keith Perez 放棄 2500 萬用戶的 Tome，因為團隊自己都不喜歡那個產品；他判斷 CRM 的勝負手不是讓銷售多幹活，而是能不能把公司的客戶現實完整建模。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>16</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CRM</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 原生應用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Are bad teeth the number one reason kids go to A&amp;E? NEET P-Doom dentine\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-moreorless-儿童看急诊第一原因是牙-数字被念错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">28:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>兒童看急診第一原因是牙？數字被唸錯了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英國議員說牙齒問題是兒童進急診的第一原因，實際數字指的是5到18歲因蛀牙住院治療——兩者不是一回事，而蛀牙率其實在緩慢下降。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">事實核查</span><span class=\"tag\">公共衛生</span>\n</div></div></a>"]